---
import ArrowIcon from "./ArrowIcon.astro";
import { githubOrganizations } from "../data/site";
---

<section class="github-portal section-light" id="open">
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="section-heading section-heading--wide">
      <h2>从这里，继续向外生长。</h2>
      <p>公开项目与技术资料将逐步汇聚到 9fields；九野通衢的内部工程由 GitHub 组织 JiuyeTongqu 承载。</p>
    </header>
    <div class="organization-list">
      {githubOrganizations.map((organization) => (
        <a class="organization-row" href={organization.url} rel="external">
          <span class="organization-row__name">{organization.name}</span>
          <span class="organization-row__description">{organization.description}</span>
          <span class="organization-row__action">访问 GitHub <ArrowIcon direction="external" /></span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
